{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemorylease", "label": "InMemoryLease", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "The dev/test Lease implementation; instances sharing a name mutually exclude correctly, but only inside one process.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_coordination_in_memory_lease_inmemoryleasestore", "label": "inMemoryLeaseStore", "file_type": "code", "rationale": "One module-global store means no per-instance registry to wire up \u2014 and equally that mutual exclusion cannot cross a process boundary. Clear it directly to reset shared lease state between tests.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_coordination_in_memory_lease_leaseoptions", "label": "LeaseOptions", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_coordination_in_memory_lease_required_fields", "label": "name, owner and ttlMs are required", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "The constructor throws OptionsError rather than building a lease that cannot exclude anyone: two leases with no owner both compete under the same undefined holder and both win, and with no ttlMs the expiry is NaN, so an existing holder always reads as expired.", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/coordination/in-memory-lease.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_coordination_in_memory_lease_multinodespec_pattern", "label": "The MultiNodeSpec lease pattern", "fi